; captured_trap.claims — the same `accountability` claim as any_model, written
; as the politics.lib claim-form invocation (kernel §6 / politics §7). On
; captured_trap.pol this claim FAILS: once the watchdog is captured, the case
; can no longer reach `concluded`, and the witness names the capture move.
;
; stdlib loads first because politics.lib.pol's `swing` form references stdlib's
; `toggle` (see any_model.claims).

